    "name": "### Topic: Stages of Child Development - Infancy (बाल विकास की अवस्थाएँ - शैशवकाल)",
    "description": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>Infancy Period · शैशवकाल का समय</title>\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts & Font Awesome -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" />\n\n    <style>\n        /* ─── Minimal & Clean Setup ─── */\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n            background: #f8f6fc;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            padding: 2rem 1rem;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Ultra Clean Main Card ─── */\n        .premium-card {\n            max-width: 850px;\n            width: 100%;\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            padding: 2.5rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(108, 60, 176, 0.06);\n            border: 1px solid #eee9f8;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 640px) {\n            .premium-card { padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 16px; }\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Top Badges & Headings ─── */\n        .top-badge {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 6px;\n            background: #f1ecf9;\n            color: #6c3cb0;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n            padding: 0.4rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: 100px;\n            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .main-heading {\n            font-size: 1.6rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .main-heading span.purple-text {\n            color: #6c3cb0;\n        }\n\n        .sub-heading {\n            color: #6a598c;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .sub-heading::before {\n            content: '';\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 14px;\n            background: #9f6ee3;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Question Container ─── */\n        .question-container {\n            background: #fcfbfe;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            border: 1px solid #f3effa;\n        }\n\n        .question-container .q-meta {\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            color: #9f6ee3;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n        }\n\n        .question-container .q-main-text {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .question-container .q-translation {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #5c4d7d;\n            font-size: 1.05rem;\n            margin-top: 0.4rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Minimal Options Layout ─── */\n        .options-list {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 0.85rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 640px) {\n            .options-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n        }\n\n        .option-box {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;\n            border: 1.5px solid #eae5f2;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.85rem;\n            transition: all 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n        .option-box.selected-correct {\n            border-color: #10b981;\n            background: #f0fdf4;\n        }\n\n        .option-box .idx {\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            width: 26px;\n            height: 26px;\n            background: #f4f0fa;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: #793fc6;\n        }\n\n        .option-box.selected-correct .idx {\n            background: #10b981;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .option-box .txt {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        .option-box .txt small {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #6a598c;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            margin-left: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .option-box .icon-status {\n            margin-left: auto;\n            color: #10b981;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Clean Alert Banner ─── */\n        .alert-banner {\n            background: #10b981;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Clean Analysis Grid ─── */\n        .grid-heading {\n            font-size: 1.15rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .grid-heading i { color: #6c3cb0; }\n\n        .analysis-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 1.25rem;\n            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .analysis-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n        }\n\n        .analysis-item {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 1.4rem;\n            border: 1px solid #eae5f2;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .analysis-item::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: #dcd0ee;\n            border-radius: 16px 0 0 16px;\n        }\n\n        .analysis-item.active-highlight::before {\n            background: #10b981;\n        }\n\n        .analysis-item .item-title {\n            font-weight: 800;\n            font-size: 1.05rem;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n        }\n\n        .analysis-item .item-title span.tag {\n            font-size: 0.65rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            background: #f4f0fa;\n            color: #793fc6;\n            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .analysis-item.active-highlight .item-title span.tag {\n            background: #e6f7f0;\n            color: #10b981;\n        }\n\n        .analysis-item .item-sub-meta {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #793fc6;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .analysis-item .item-desc {\n            font-size: 0.88rem;\n            color: #5c4d7d;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.4rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Simplified Insight Section ─── */\n        .insight-section {\n            background: #fcfbfe;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            border: 1px solid #f3effa;\n        }\n\n        .insight-section .insight-title {\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            font-size: 1.05rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.85rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-section .insight-title i { color: #f59e0b; }\n\n        .insight-text {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #5c4d7d;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Minimal Footer ─── */\n        .minimal-footer {\n            margin-top: 2.5rem;\n            font-size: 0.78rem;\n            color: #9c8fb8;\n            text-align: center;\n            border-top: 1px solid #f3effa;\n            padding-top: 1.25rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"premium-card\">\n\n        <!-- Top Badge -->\n        <div class=\"top-badge\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-child-rearing\"></i> Child Development · बाल विकास\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Heading Area -->\n        <div class=\"main-heading\">\n            <span class=\"purple-text\">Stages of Development</span> &amp; Chronology\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sub-heading\">\n            Standard Chronological Classification · विकासात्मक अवस्थाओं का कालक्रम\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Question Container -->\n        <div class=\"question-container\">\n            <div class=\"q-meta\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-question\"></i> Image Reference: 1364308f-f100-45b0-b4b2-c2c899b7762e</div>\n            <div class=\"q-main-text\">\n                The period of infancy-hood is:\n                <span class=\"q-translation\">शैशवकाल का समय है:</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Options Configuration -->\n        <div class=\"options-list\">\n            <div class=\"option-box\">\n                <div class=\"idx\">1</div>\n                <div class=\"txt\">12 to 18 years <small>· 12 वर्ष से 18 वर्ष तक</small></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"option-box\">\n                <div class=\"idx\">2</div>\n                <div class=\"txt\">Up to 15 years <small>· 15 वर्ष तक</small></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"option-box\">\n                <div class=\"idx\">3</div>\n                <div class=\"txt\">Birth to 6 years <small>· जन्म से 6 वर्ष तक</small></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"option-box selected-correct\">\n                <div class=\"idx\">4</div>\n                <div class=\"txt\">Birth to 2 years <small>· जन्म से 2 वर्ष तक</small></div>\n                <div class=\"icon-status\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-check\"></i></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Alert Success Banner -->\n        <div class=\"alert-banner\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-check-double\"></i>\n            Correct Answer: **Birth to 2 Years** · जन्म से 2 वर्ष तक\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Analysis Section -->\n        <div class=\"grid-heading\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-align-left\"></i> Key Developmental Stages Breakdown\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"analysis-grid\">\n            <!-- Infancy-hood -->\n            <div class=\"analysis-item active-highlight\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">Infancy-hood / शैशवावस्था <span class=\"tag\">Correct</span></div>\n                <div class=\"item-sub-meta\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i> Timeline: Birth to 2 Years · जन्म से 2 वर्ष तक</div>\n                <div class=\"item-desc\">\n                    <span>**English:** Period of rapid physical, motor, and sensory development. Marked by reflexive actions initially and building object permanence.</span>\n                    <span>**Hindi:** तीव्र शारीरिक, गामक और संवेदी विकास की अवस्था। मानसिक रूप से बच्चा अपनी इंद्रियों और मूल प्रवृत्तियों द्वारा सीखता है।</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Childhood -->\n            <div class=\"analysis-item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">Childhood / बाल्यावस्था <span class=\"tag\">Stage 2 &amp; 3</span></div>\n                <div class=\"item-sub-meta\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i> Timeline: 2 to 12 Years · 2 से 12 वर्ष तक</div>\n                <div class=\"item-desc\">\n                    <span>**English:** Divided into Early Childhood ($2-6\\text{ yrs}$, toy age/pre-school) and Later Childhood ($6-12\\text{ yrs}$, gang age/elementary school).</span>\n                    <span>**Hindi:** इसे पूर्व-बाल्यावस्था ($2-6$ वर्ष, खेलने की उम्र) और उत्तर-बाल्यावस्था ($6-12$ वर्ष, स्कूली या गिरोह की उम्र) में विभाजित किया गया है।</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Adolescence -->\n            <div class=\"analysis-item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">Adolescence / किशोरावस्था <span class=\"tag\">Stage 4</span></div>\n                <div class=\"item-sub-meta\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i> Timeline: 12 to 18 Years · 12 से 18 वर्ष तक</div>\n                <div class=\"item-desc\">\n                    <span>**English:** Defined by Stanley Hall as a period of \"Storm and Stress\". Transition period between childhood and adulthood.</span>\n                    <span>**Hindi:** स्टेनली हॉल द्वारा इसे **\"अत्यधिक तनाव, तूफान और संघर्ष की अवस्था\"** कहा गया है। इसमें पहचान का संकट (Identity Crisis) होता है।</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- General Context -->\n            <div class=\"analysis-item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">Note on Variations / वर्गीकरण अंतर <span class=\"tag\">TET Alert</span></div>\n                <div class=\"item-sub-meta\"><i class=\"fas fa-scale-balanced\"></i> Standard vs Regional Classifications</div>\n                <div class=\"item-desc\">\n                    <span>**English:** According to global standards (and NCERT/Piaget), Infancy is $0-2\\text{ years}$. However, older traditional timelines (like Jones) sometimes group $0-6\\text{ years}$ as infancy. Go with $0-2$ as per recent question architectures.</span>\n                    <span>**Hindi:** सामान्यतः वैश्विक एवं पियाजे के अनुसार शैशवकाल $0-2$ वर्ष है, परंतु कुछ पुराने वर्गीकरणों (जैसे अर्नेस्ट जोन्स) में इसे $0-6$ वर्ष भी माना जाता है। परीक्षा में आधिकारिक कुंजी $0-2$ को प्राथमिकता देती है।</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- High-Yield Insight -->\n        <div class=\"insight-section\">\n            <div class=\"insight-title\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"></i> Quick Revision Matrix</div>\n            <div class=\"insight-text\">\n                **English Summary:** Infancy ($0-2\\text{ yrs}$) $\\rightarrow$ Early Childhood ($2-6\\text{ yrs}$) $\\rightarrow$ Later Childhood ($6-12\\text{ yrs}$) $\\rightarrow$ Adolescence ($12-18\\text{ yrs}$). <br>\n                **Hindi Summary:** शैशवावस्था ($0-2$ वर्ष) $\\rightarrow$ पूर्व-बाल्यावस्था ($2-6$ वर्ष) $\\rightarrow$ उत्तर-बाल्यावस्था ($6-12$ वर्ष) $\\rightarrow$ किशोरावस्था ($12-18$ वर्ष)।\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <div class=\"minimal-footer\">\n            High-Yield TET Study Tool · Standard Developmental Chronology Scale\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
